o de pal\u00edndromo?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"\u201cRadar\u201d \u00e9 um pal\u00edndromo; a palavra \u201cpal\u00edndromo\u201d tem origem no grego e significa \u201ccorrer de volta\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-781e-9d8b-1a0ac78519ba","description":"Radar","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-7a33-b6d6-ac5cf495fef0","description":"Smash","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-70e3-ab9a-385df0472452","description":"Internet","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-7ef9-9222-bc220260e176","description":"Foguete","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-70de-a29e-c24491a84b4b","category":"01a21348-94aa-7eae-ba09-829334cba03f","question":"Qual \u00e9 o verbo que significa encurtar uma palavra ou frase omitindo letras?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Abreviar \u00e9 encurtar uma palavra ou frase; \u201cDr.\u201d \u00e9 uma forma abreviada convencional de \u201cdoutor\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-7581-bc71-5b69b9ce4426","description":"Abreviar","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-7d5c-a121-e5fcc176f243","description":"Abolir","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-7f2d-8dc8-833a54543129","description":"Sequestrar","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-7373-a525-11bde5079f11","description":"Abominar","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-7e35-a89a-fc8e228eb88c","category":"01a21348-94aa-7eae-ba09-829334cba03f","question":"Qual palavra descreve algo que \u00e9 dif\u00edcil de ler, como uma caligrafia ruim?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"\u201cIleg\u00edvel\u201d significa que n\u00e3o est\u00e1 claro o suficiente para ser lido. \u201cInvis\u00edvel\u201d significa que n\u00e3o pode ser visto, enquanto \u201cil\u00edcito\u201d e \u201cilegal\u201d descrevem algo proibido pela lei ou pelas regras.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-7887-8892-a566fdfbe4e4","description":"Ileg\u00edvel","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-aee6-70d4-af36-d37ceb544493","description":"Invis\u00edvel"